# The vehicle's own repository.
#
# The configuration, the tools and the referee are source; everything a run produces is not.
# `.scratch/` is where a round verifies itself by breaking copies — the folder's law is that a
# refusal nobody has seen fire is indistinguishable from a check that always passes, and the
# verifiers that prove otherwise are scratch by design.

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Round verifiers, and any diode directory a console was pointed at.
.scratch/
volumes/
